{
  "lecture_id": "lecture-08",
  "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "小卷积核只提供局部连接；浅层示例中相距很远的输入没有共同接收二者的节点，因此跨区域比较需要更长路径或另一种混合机制。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 4
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "把图像裁成 patches，再用可学习线性投影把每块变成 d 维向量；这些向量作为 Transformer 的 tokens。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "每个输出 token 是输入 token 向量的标量加权和；W 左乘 token 矩阵，混合行而不直接混合代码坐标。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "共享函数 F_θ 独立作用于每个 token，通常由 MLP 实现；这一步不读取其他 token。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "attention 使用由输入产生的矩阵 A 来混合 tokens，因此权重可以随当前输入变化。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 20
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 30
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "同一 token 集产生 Q、K、V；所有 query-key 点积构成匹配矩阵，经缩放和 softmax 得 A，随后 A 加权汇聚 V。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 30
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "k 个 heads 各自计算 attention，输出按 token 位置拼接成 N×kv，再由 W_MSA 投影到 d 维。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 37
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ViT 伪代码先归一化 tokens 后计算 attention 并加残差，再归一化后通过逐 token MLP 并加第二条残差；这一过程重复 L 层。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 39
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "若输入 token 行按某置换重排，Transformer 输出也按同一置换重排；等变不表示每个输出位置保持不动。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 41
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "当任务需要位置敏感性时，可向 token code vectors 添加位置信息；本包不保留 flagged chunk 中的具体位置公式。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 43
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "causal mask 使当前输出只能使用允许的先前 tokens；一次矩阵运算仍能同时为多个时间位置产生训练预测。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 51
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "图像编码器在视觉 tokens 内做 self-attention；文本解码器使用 causal self-attention，并通过 cross-attention 读取图像 tokens。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 54
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
